WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.370
This is Clix.

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.930
Clix stars in your product video.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.050
Then the design team moves one button.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.080
Clix clicks where it used to be.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.890
All three versions of your video go stale.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:23.080
TeaserKit writes the video down.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:28.570
Every click, caption and camera move lives in one storyboard.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.420
The button moved.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.340
So you change one beat.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:33.830
Build again.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:40.010
Landscape, vertical and square come from the same storyboard, each framed on its own.

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.320
Put private words on the deny list.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:47.520
If one appears on screen, recording stops.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.310
And you still watch every frame before you share it.

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:04.370
TeaserKit.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.650
Change the interface.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.380
Re-shoot the same story.
